## Automation & Scheduling

### Using Cron

```bash
# Add to crontab
crontab -e

# Daily at 2 AM
0 2 * * * /path/to/tool command

# Every 6 hours
0 */6 * * * /path/to/tool command
```

### Using Systemd

```ini
# /etc/systemd/system/tool.service
[Unit]
Description=Tool Service
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
User=username
ExecStart=/path/to/tool daemon
Restart=on-failure

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

### Using Scripts

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# automation-script.sh

# Script logic here
if [ condition ]; then
    tool command1
else
    tool command2
fi
```

